# Ella Sun villa videos — keep heavy AI-generated source/intermediate media OUT of git.
# Only the FINAL deliverables (final/*.mp4) + READMEs are tracked, so they can be
# pulled/edited from any machine without bloating the repo with the full 1.8GB.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!**/README.md
!**/final/*.mp4

# The 416MB Cocos master exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file hard limit — never track it.
ella-sun/villa-cocos/final/וילה*.mp4

# EXCEPTION (2026-07-15): villa-cocos 9:16 short prep is tracked so work can
# continue across machines (12 AI shots, frames, VO). ~250MB, all files <100MB.
!ella-sun/villa-cocos/_cocos_short_prep/**

# EXCEPTION (2026-07-22): villa-mountain 9:16 reel working set is tracked so work can
# continue across machines (11 shots, 8 VO lines, 9:16 source images, build script). ~61MB.
!ella-sun/villa-mountain/_mountain_reel_prep/**

# EXCEPTION (2026-08-09): villa-shikma working set — 37 real listing photos (~7MB) +
# scripts, so the Shikma tour can be pulled/edited from the MacBook. Keep heavy Kling
# renders out; only final/*.mp4 (whitelisted above) ships. 4K masters >100MB stay out.
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/**
ella-sun/villa-shikma/**/*_4k.mp4
